    "promptText": "Title: Assignment: Sources of Support (Developing Grit)\n\nDescription:\n\nIf \"grit\" is developed through continuously facing setbacks without giving up, then your available support systems greatly increase your chances of developing \"grit.\" These groups help us keep things in perspective and continue to search for success when we are met with adversity.\n\nThe Task:\n\nUsing 5 sentences, explore this concept in your own life. Please answer the following questions in your response:\n\n- What communities are you a part of that will offer you this support?\n- How can you become a part of new communities that offer this support?\n- What have communities done for you in the past that helped you succeed?\n- Are you a part of any communities that hinder your success?\n\nWhat your work needs to show:\n\n- I can manage my own support system by naming the communities that support me, what they have done to help me succeed, and whether any hold me back (required)\n- I can take initiative by naming a specific step I can take on my own to join a new community that could support me\n\nYou can also show:\n\n- I can plan how to build my network by naming a new sports, entertainment, or events group I could join and saying how I would get involved and stay connected\n\nSubmission:\n\nSubmit your paragraph as a Text Entry.",
