    "promptText": "Title: Assignment: CHHS Brand Audit (The Home Field Advantage)\n\nDescription:\n\nYou walk the halls every day, but have you ever looked at Clover Hill High School as a brand? Just like a sports team or a clothing line, our school has an image, a target audience, and a reputation.\n\nThe Task:\n\nConduct a brand audit of Clover Hill High School. Write a 250 word (minimum) essay covering the following three areas.\n\n1. Target Market Identification (Min. 75 words)\n\n- Who are we serving?\n- Identify the target market (Demographics and Psychographics).\n\n2. Brand Quality Assessment (Min. 100 words)\n\n- Assess the quality of the current \"Cavalier\" brand.\n- What do the logo, the colors, and the reputation say to the community?\n- Determine specific areas for improvement.\n\n3. Cultural and Societal Trends (Min. 75 words)\n\n- Analyze current cultural and societal trends that may impact rebranding efforts (e.g., social media, mental health awareness).\n\nWhat your work needs to show:\n\n- I can evaluate a school brand by explaining what the Cavalier logo, colors, and reputation say to the community and naming specific areas for improvement (required)\n- I can explain target marketing by identifying who Clover Hill High School serves using both demographics and psychographics in at least 75 words\n- I can explain reasons for rebranding by showing how current cultural and societal trends, such as social media or mental health awareness, could push the school to rebrand\n\nYou can also show:\n\n- I can write a clear essay of at least 250 words that meets the word count for each section and is checked for spelling and grammar\n- I can analyze trends by naming at least one current trend and explaining how it changes what students and the community expect from the school's brand\n\nSubmission:\n\nSubmit your essay as a Text Entry.",
