    "promptText": "Title: Assignment: SWOT Analysis (The War Room)\n\nDescription:\n\nA SWOT Analysis is the foundation of any marketing plan. It helps businesses understand where they stand compared to the competition.\n\nThe Task:\n\nSelect a major Sports Team or Entertainment Company (e.g., The Commanders, Disney, Netflix). Complete a SWOT Analysis for them.\n\n1. Internal Factors (Inside the Building)\n\n- List 2 Strengths: (e.g., Loyal fan base, star player).\n- List 2 Weaknesses: (e.g., Old stadium, high ticket prices).\n\n2. External Factors (Outside the World)\n\n- List 2 Opportunities: (e.g., Expanding to international markets).\n- List 2 Threats: (e.g., Rising inflation, a new competitor).\n\n3. The Strategy\n\n- Based on your analysis, give one specific recommendation to the General Manager.\n\nWhat your work needs to show:\n\n- I can analyze a team or company's position by naming 2 internal strengths, 2 weaknesses, 2 outside opportunities and 2 threats it faces (required)\n- I can explain competition by naming at least one real competitor or competing option in my analysis and explaining how it affects my team or company\n\nYou can also show:\n\n- I can plan a marketing move by giving the General Manager one specific recommendation and showing which parts of my SWOT analysis it comes from\n\nSubmission:\n\nSubmit your analysis as a Text Entry.",
