    "promptText": "Title: Project: The First E-Sports Olympic Games\n\nDescription:\n\nYou are responsible for creating a new sport to be introduced as a competition at the first E-Sports Olympic Games. As part of this process, you will also be identifying potential sponsors.\n\nThe Task:\n\nChoose a partner. Create a presentation or proposal addressing the three sections below.\n\nSection 1: The New Sport (Product Development)\n\n- Name & Concept: What is it called? How does it work?\n- The Rules: What are the rules of competition?\n- The Appeal: Why would this be a good event for the Olympics?\n\nSection 2: The Fan (Target Market)\n\n- Demographics: Who is watching?\n- Psychographics: Why will your event appeal to this group?\n\nSection 3: The Money (Sponsorships)\n\n- Select Sponsors: Identify specific companies that would want to pay to be associated with your sport.\n- The Strategy: Why would they be likely sponsors?\n- Advertising: How will advertising play a role in the event?\n- What Could Go Wrong: Name two things you can't control that could hurt your event (a server outage, a game update, a rule change, a scandal) and how you would plan for each.\n\nWhat your work needs to show:\n\n- I can plan a new product by giving my sport a name and concept, explaining how it works and its rules, and why it would make a good Olympic event (required)\n- I can explain target marketing by describing who watches my sport using demographics and using psychographics to explain why my event appeals to them\n- I can explain sponsorship by naming specific companies that would sponsor my sport and explaining why each would want to be connected to it\n\nYou can also show:\n\n- I can collaborate with a partner by each of us building clear parts of the proposal and combining them into one project that fits together\n- I can plan for things outside my control by naming two things that could hurt my event and explaining how I would prepare for each\n- I can explain advertising at events by showing how advertising will appear at my event and how it helps my sponsors reach fans\n\nSubmission:\n\nSubmit your project as a File Upload.",
