    "promptText": "Title: Assignment: My Cause My Cleats (The Power of Strategic Partnership)\n\nDescription:\n\nWhen an athlete partners with a non profit, it is a powerful form of Co Branding. It builds their public image while driving massive awareness for a cause. We are looking at the NFL \"My Cause My Cleats\" campaign.\n\nThe Task:\n\nSelect one NFL athlete and the Non Profit organization they represented. Answer the following in a minimum of 100 words:\n\n- Who is the athlete and what is the organization?\n- The Why: Explain the connection. Did the athlete choose this cause because of a personal experience?\n- The Impact: From a marketing perspective, how does this partnership help the athlete's personal brand and the non profit organization?\n\nWhat your work needs to show:\n\n- I can explain public relations in sports by showing, as a marketer would, how the My Cause My Cleats partnership helps both the athlete's personal brand and the non profit (required)\n- I can see the bigger picture by connecting why my athlete chose this cause to what both the athlete and the non profit gain from it\n- I can identify sponsorship trends by explaining how my athlete and non profit teaming up for My Cause My Cleats is co-branding with a cause\n\nYou can also show:\n\n- I can think critically by backing up my answer about why the athlete chose this cause with facts I found, not just a guess\n- I can show respect for others by describing my athlete's cause and the people it serves with care\n\nSubmission:\n\nSubmit your analysis as a Text Entry.",
