    "promptText": "Title: Assignment: Future Proofing Your Career (AI and the Job Market)\n\nDescription:\n\nArtificial Intelligence is shifting the employment landscape faster than any technology since the internet. To succeed in this new economy, you must be adaptable.\n\nThe Task:\n\nConduct research on how AI will change the job market over the next 10 years.\n\n1. The Essay (200 Words)\n\n- Provide a 200 word essay describing the predicted changes to the workforce.\n- Explain specifically how you can ensure that you are properly prepared for this changing landscape.\n\n2. The Data\n\n- List the five fastest growing industries predicted for the next decade.\n- Identify one specific job within these industries that you would be interested in researching further.\n\n3. The Sources\n\n- You must cite at least three different sources used in your research.\n\nWhat your work needs to show:\n\n- I can plan to adapt to a changing job market by explaining in my 200-word essay how AI may reshape work, how I can prepare, and one job to research (required)\n- I can find and use reliable information by listing the five fastest growing industries predicted for the next decade and citing at least three different sources from my research\n\nSubmission:\n\nSubmit your work as a File Upload or Text Entry.",
